## What I Learned

### Multi-Agent Collaboration Improves Results

Instead of depending on one AI response, specialized agents can work together to produce more reliable and higher-quality outputs.

### Workflow Orchestration Is Critical

Separating planning, execution, evaluation, and refinement makes AI systems easier to scale, debug, and improve.

### Feedback Loops Increase Quality

Continuous evaluation and iterative refinement allow autonomous systems to improve their outputs before completion.

### Production AI Requires Coordination

Modern AI applications rely on orchestration, memory management, and stopping conditions to ensure stable and efficient execution.

